Ox Network Stack (akin to RNS)
================

An OxCaml implementation of the public-domain Reticulum protocol.

Ox.Ns provides a native network stack for heterogeneous,
decentralized, and resilient communications.

Build:   make build
Test:    make test
Format:  make fmt
Check:   make

Specification: https://reticulum.network/manual/

Status: Experimental.

